         "h": 0,
         "a": "very big (x2): huge, enormous · laugh: giggle · very small: tiny · shine: sparkle · very interesting: amazing · look (for a long time): stare · go up: rise<br><b>Verbs:</b> giggle, sparkle, stare, rise<br><b>Adjectives:</b> huge, enormous, tiny, amazing",
